# Playwright harnesses write their screenshots next to wherever they are run.
# They now all write into tests/shots/; these two names are kept because
# footer.png was committed by accident once and full-landing.png dirtied the
# tree on every run, which is noise that trains you to ignore git status.
ks-*.png
pg-*.png
footer.png
full-landing.png
tests/node_modules/
tests/shots/
